# Official Smart Node image pins.
# `rocketpool service config` writes container-tag changes into this file.
# The next `rocketpool service install` replaces it with the official catalog.
#
# Client images have _PROD (mainnet) and _TEST (testnet/devnet) variants.
# They may be equal today; keep both so they can diverge without a format change.
# Values are repo:tag@sha256:<index-digest> so Docker verifies the image and still
# selects the correct architecture.

